{
  "spoken_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_intro_01",
      "string_id": "10032184471124475610",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Mara's own memories are holding. The foreign ones are indexed, not gone. Pair Zero-Seven-B can still name every identity inside her.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_intro_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 9200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_remove_line",
      "string_id": "6011879220330553858",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Can you take the other memories out?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_choice_remove_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_remove_01",
      "string_id": "4536982525010700394",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "I can cut their index and let them decay. Pulling at the memories themselves would tear through Mara's alongside them. The implant no longer knows where one life ends and another begins.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_remove_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 12000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_cipher_line",
      "string_id": "15558450923486674639",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "We get the cipher. What exactly does it give us?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_choice_cipher_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 4000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_cipher_01",
      "string_id": "4093553416284224867",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Names, source fragments, destination identities, every courier who carried them. Enough to restore stolen lives. Enough to sell them again.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_cipher_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_morrow_line",
      "string_id": "15998294567639930988",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Morrow knew this was possible?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_choice_morrow_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_morrow_01",
      "string_id": "3830259798374641228",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "He suspected. Now he calls the index a route to Morita. He is not wrong. That is what makes his answer dangerous.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_morrow_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8400
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_patch_line",
      "string_id": "5923637928010802746",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Did Patch put Mara on the route?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_choice_patch_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3200
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_patch_01",
      "string_id": "8583931243967429240",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "He moved sealed implants between two handoffs. He says he never chose the carriers. Ask whether ignorance was part of the price or part of the service.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_patch_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 10000
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_vehicle_line",
      "string_id": "3767841479547207232",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Where is Zero-Seven-B now?",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_choice_vehicle_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 2800
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_vehicle_01",
      "string_id": "16858215699038389426",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Northside freight interchange. The beacon marked its parking row. Patch has a vehicle that will pass the first gate.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_vehicle_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_rsp_vehicle_02",
      "string_id": "16858214599526761215",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Morrow sees a route to the person at the top. I see a list of people the route can hurt again.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_rsp_vehicle_02.wem",
      "duration_ms": 7600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_close_line",
      "string_id": "15693665257298050630",
      "speaker": "V",
      "addressee": "Iris",
      "text": "Keep Mara stable. I'll bring you the cipher.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_v_close_line.wem",
      "duration_ms": 3600
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_iris_close_01",
      "string_id": "12691115196843528116",
      "speaker": "Iris",
      "addressee": "V",
      "text": "Bring it to the relay, not here. If it opens in this room, every memory in it gets another chance to become someone.",
      "audio_path": "mod\\gq003\\localization\\en-us\\vo\\gq003_20_iris_close_01.wem",
      "duration_ms": 8800
    }
  ],
  "choice_lines": [
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_remove_short",
      "string_id": "5370849004066223290",
      "text": "Can you remove the memories?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_cipher_short",
      "string_id": "16141948987735503261",
      "text": "What happens if we recover the cipher?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_morrow_short",
      "string_id": "3830924745142080112",
      "text": "Morrow knew?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_patch_short",
      "string_id": "14276928173172084818",
      "text": "Patch sent her into this?"
    },
    {
      "key": "gq003_20_v_choice_vehicle_short",
      "string_id": "15467626283417032820",
      "text": "Where's the vehicle?"
    }
  ],
  "audio_durations_ms": {
